{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KXPohGFw1TXmH5Nc5DpIdO","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2688\">\n    <frame id=\"3:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"3:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"3:5\" name=\"Budget — monthly expenses, bills and credit score\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"3:6\" name=\"Design a personal budgeting app: see this month’s spending against the budget by category, check the monthly subscriptions, and review the credit score. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"3:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 3 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only the platform shell (status bar, home indicator) — this task has no primary button and no text input. Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the service logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"765\">\n      <text id=\"3:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"676\">\n        <frame id=\"3:14\" name=\"01_Expenses\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"3:15\" name=\"01_Expenses\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"116\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"3:16\" name=\"Goal: See how much of this month’s budget is spent, by category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:18\" name=\"• Budget: “Left to spend” $738 · “Monthly budget” $2,550 · progress of spending against the budget • Categories: Auto &amp; transport · Bill &amp; Utilities, each with icon, total and item rows with amount, amount left and progress (see DATA) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Expenses” · add (Icon_Plus) • Main navigation: tab bar Overview / This Month / Offers / Setting · current: This Month • More: more categories (Icon_More) • Period: “September 2020” (Icon_Chevron_Down) · total spent $1,812\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"3:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:20\" name=\"→ Bill &amp; Utilities card → 02_Bill\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:21\" name=\"02_Bill\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"3:22\" name=\"02_Bill\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"59\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"3:23\" name=\"Goal: See what I pay for subscriptions each month.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:25\" name=\"• Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Bill” · add (Icon_Plus) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: This Month • Segments: Bills · Payments · Subscription · current: Subscription • Subscriptions: Patreon membership · Netflix · Apple payment · Spotify, each with logo, monthly price and open (Icon_Chevron_Right) (see DATA) • Summary: “Your monthly payment for subscriptions” · $58.97\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"3:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:27\" name=\"→ back → 01_Expenses\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:28\" name=\"03_Credit_Score\" x=\"0\" y=\"380\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"3:29\" name=\"03_Credit_Score\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"147\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"3:30\" name=\"Goal: Understand my credit score and what drives it.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:32\" name=\"• Factors: On-time payments · Credit Utilization · Age of credit, each with value, rating and detail (see DATA) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Credit Score” • Main navigation: tab bar · current: This Month • Score: 660 · “Good” · +6pts · range 400 – 850 · “Last update on 20 Jul 2020”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"3:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:34\" name=\"→ back → 01_Expenses\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:35\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1345\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\">\n      <text id=\"3:36\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:37\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar on all 3 frames with 4 tabs in this order: Overview (Icon_Overview), This Month (Icon_This_Month), Offers (Icon_Offers), Setting (Icon_Setting). Current: This Month on all three. How the current tab looks is yours. • 01_Expenses is the This Month screen. 02_Bill is pushed from the Bill &amp; Utilities card; back returns to 01. • 03_Credit_Score: the source shows no entry point — link it from wherever you see fit; its back returns to 01_Expenses. • Entry only (no frame): period picker, add, more categories, item rows, Bills and Payments segments, subscription rows, factor rows, Overview / Offers / Setting tabs.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"110\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:38\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"401\">\n      <text id=\"3:39\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:40\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:41\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"312\">\n        <frame id=\"3:42\" name=\"Period and totals\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"3:43\" name=\"Period and totals\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:44\" name=\"September 2020 · spent $1,812 Left to spend $738 · Monthly budget $2,550\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:45\" name=\"Auto &amp; transport · $600 (Icon_Car)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"3:46\" name=\"Auto &amp; transport · $600 (Icon_Car)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:47\" name=\"Auto &amp; transport · $350 · Left $186 Auto insurance · $250 · Left $120\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:48\" name=\"Bill &amp; Utilities · $320 (Icon_Bill)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"3:49\" name=\"Bill &amp; Utilities · $320 (Icon_Bill)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"209\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:50\" name=\"Subscriptions · $52 · Left $0 House service · $138 · Left $10 Maintenance · $130 · Left $30\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:51\" name=\"Subscriptions (02, in this order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"149\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"3:52\" name=\"Subscriptions (02, in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"218\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:53\" name=\"Total: Your monthly payment for subscriptions · $58.97 Patreon membership · $19.99/mo (Logo_Patreon) Netflix · $12/mo (Logo_Netflix) Apple payment · $19.99/mo (Logo_Apple) Spotify · $6.99/mo (Logo_Spotify)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:54\" name=\"Credit score (03)\" x=\"444\" y=\"149\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"3:55\" name=\"Credit score (03)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:56\" name=\"660 · Good · +6pts Range 400 – 850 · Last update on 20 Jul 2020\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:57\" name=\"Factors (03, in this order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"149\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"3:58\" name=\"Factors (03, in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"175\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:59\" name=\"On-time payments · 95% · Good · 1 missed Credit Utilization · 95% · Not bad · -15% Age of credit · 8 years · Good\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:60\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2003\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"3:61\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:62\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"3:63\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"3:64\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"3:65\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #6347EB and DM Sans • Media: service logos, icons • Platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:66\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"3:67\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"3:68\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, category and progress colors, rating colors (good / not bad), gauge, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, current segment, pressed, disabled • Headers, tab bar, segmented tabs, period picker, budget summary, category cards, progress rows, subscription rows, credit gauge, factor rows • How progress and the score gauge are visualized\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:69\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2343\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"3:70\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:71\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"3:72\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, current segment, progress and gauge)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"3:73\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 3 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"d93773f7-1030-4f5f-885c-c0ec0b1095a1","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:31:12.876Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2688\">\n    <frame id=\"3:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"3:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"3:5\" name=\"Budget — monthly expenses, bills and credit score\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <t