{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOm5womuw74NWjych1Af","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for the next step: I have the brief, foundations, components and media structure, so what remains is icon vector geometry and the actual screens.\n\nOne simpler route than reading vector paths and recreating icons: copy the component nodes from the reference pages directly into the workspace page with clone. Clone across pages works, and appending the clone to a frame on another page preserves it exactly, which fits \"Create the complete design inside 03 · Workspace\" with reuse from 02. So the workspace page gets a \"Components · Budget\" section holding clones of Status Bar, Home Indicator, each icon component (2:2..2:12) and logos (2:13..2:16), renamed. Cloning a component gives a copy component, which is fine; icons are neutral #1A1A1F vectors and recolor through instance children fills, while logos stay at 48x48 unaltered.\n\nThe design system: brand #6347EB violet; neutrals ink #1A1A1F, secondary #6E6A7C, tertiary #9A95A8, borders #ECEAF2, surface #FFFFFF, page bg #F6F5FA. Category accents are Auto & transport #2D9CFF and Bill & Utilities #F5A63C, with status good #1FA97B, not bad #F5A63C, over budget #E5484D. Type is DM Sans: Display 34/40 Bold (score 660), H1 24/30 Bold, H2 20/26 Bold, Title 16/22 SemiBold, Body 14/20 Regular, Body strong 14/20 Medium, Caption 12/16 Regular, Micro 11/14 Medium. Spacing 4/8/12/16/20/24; radii 8/12/16/24. Screens are 375x812 light.\n\n01_Expenses stacks status bar 44 on white, header 56 (back left, \"Expenses\" center, add right), a period row (\"September 2020\" with chevron down, \"Spent $1,812\" right), a violet gradient budget card with \"Monthly budget $2,550\", \"Left to spend\" $738 at 34 Bold, a 6px progress bar at 71% (1812/2550) and \"Spent $1,812\" / \"71% of $2,550\", then an Auto & transport card at $600 with Icon_Car and rows \"Auto & transport $350 Left $186\" and \"Auto insurance $250 Left $120\", a Bill & Utilities card at $320 with Icon_Bill and rows Subscriptions $52 Left $0, House service $138 Left $10, Maintenance $130 Left $30, a \"More categories\" row with Icon_More, a credit teaser (660 · Good) linking to 03, and a 4-tab bar with This Month current. The content frame is a fixed 638px scroll area (812 - 44 - 56 - 74) with a taller auto-layout child and clipping, so 01 scrolls.\n\n02_Bill has the header, a segmented control Bills|Payments|Subscription with Subscription active, 4 subscription rows with logos, a summary card \"Your monthly payment for subscriptions $58.97\" and the tab bar. 03_Credit_Score has the header, a gauge card where 660 maps to (660-400)/450 = 57.8% on the 400-850 arc, \"Good\", \"+6pts\", \"Last update on 20 Jul 2020\", and factor rows: On-time payments 95% Good \"1 missed\", Credit Utilization 95% Not bad \"-15%\", Age of credit 8 years Good.\n\nComponents to master: App/Header, App/TabBar in 4 variants (Overview, This Month, Offers, Setting), App/Segmented in 3 variants, App/ProgressBar, Category/Card with 3 ItemRow slots (hiding the third for Auto), App/ItemRow, Bill/SubscriptionRow (swapping logos via swapComponent), Credit/FactorRow, Credit/Gauge, Rating chip, Budget/SummaryCard, App/PeriodPicker. I build them with a builder script, redefining helpers in each call, splitting into call A (components library), call B (screens from instances), call C (prototype and screenshots), each under the 50k character limit, loading DM Sans Regular, Medium, SemiBold and Bold before any","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":22023,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4245}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"5d2433af-d9d7-4292-a3a8-faf5b976bfbd","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:33:28.202Z","thinking_duration_ms":74984}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOm5womuw74NWjych1Af","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ymir5u0VxaAp3HpHAiCj5M","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans', style:s});\n\n// clean slate if rerun\nfor (const c of [...page.children]) c.remove();\n\nfunction solid(hex, a=1){ const h=hex.replace('#',''); return {type:'SOLID', color:{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255}, opacity:a}; }\nconst INK='#1A1A1F';\n\nconst sec = figma.createFrame(); sec.name='Components · Budget'; sec.resize(1500,1200); sec.x=-1600; sec.y=0;\nsec.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; sec.clipsContent=false; page.appendChild(sec);\n\nconst lib = figma.createFrame(); lib.name='Library / Shell · Icons · Logos'; lib.resize(1440,300); lib.x=30; lib.y=80;\nlib.fills=[solid('#F6F5FA')]; lib.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; lib.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; lib.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\nlib.paddingLeft=24; lib.paddingTop=24; lib.paddingRight=24; lib.paddingBottom=24; lib.itemSpacing=20; lib.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nsec.appendChild(lib);\n\nconst title = figma.createText(); title.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style:'Bold'}; title.fontSize=20; title.characters='Component library'; title.fills=[solid(INK)];\ntitle.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT'; title.x=30; title.y=30; sec.appendChild(title);\n\n// clone media components\nconst map = {'2:13':'Logo_Apple','2:14':'Logo_Netflix','2:15':'Logo_Patreon','2:16':'Logo_Spotify',\n '2:2':'Icon_Back','2:3':'Icon_Bill','2:4':'Icon_Car','2:5':'Icon_Chevron_Down','2:6':'Icon_Chevron_Right','2:7':'Icon_More',\n '2:8':'Icon_Offers','2:9':'Icon_Overview','2:10':'Icon_Plus','2:11':'Icon_Setting','2:12':'Icon_This_Month','1:25':'Status Bar','1:35':'Home Indicator'};\nconst comps = {};\nfor (const [id,name] of Object.entries(map)) {\n  const src = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  const c = src.clone(); lib.appendChild(c); c.name = name; comps[name]=c;\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify({ok:true, cloned:Object.keys(comps), types:Object.values(comps).map(c=>c.type+':'+c.width+'x'+c.height)});","description":"Set up workspace page, components section and clone shell, icons and logos","fileKey":"kief32CrRQEGf1OkI4f3T9"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4245,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":22023,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4245}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"1d9b0169-84be-4a2d-a6e8-d2225ceb1101","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:33:34.478Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ymir5u0VxaAp3HpHAiCj5M","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
