{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOmPVUbt7ECmKhAcvaEO","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a component build to proceed without further inspection, with corrected textAlignHorizontal and without setPluginData or createImageAsync. I keep the existing library frame and title, and place the business component masters at explicit coordinates inside the 1600-wide section frame: the column at x=30 holds the header, tab bar variants, segmented variants, progress, period picker, more row, item row, card, and subscription row; the column at x=430 holds the chip, summary, factor row, teaser, and gauge. Variants go through combineAsVariants.\n\nThe tab icons need a shared recolor helper that walks VECTOR, BOOLEAN_OPERATION, RECTANGLE, and ELLIPSE nodes with fills: the active icon becomes brand and the inactive ones become t (the tertiary grey), so unselected tabs are not stuck at #1A1A1F.\n\nThe gauge avoids the arc path command. I build the semicircle from small straight L segments every 2 degrees in one path string, with stroke 12 and round caps and joins, centered at cx=171.5 with r=100 inside a 343x200 frame; the labels 400 and 850 sit at x=51.5 and x=251.5, and the score \"660\" is font 40 Bold.\n\nI give the item row progress master a 311x4 track so nested instances fit a card's content width of 343-32=311 without resizing. The category card uses a Type=Transport and Type=Bill variant, with three named rows Row1 to Row3; the transport instance hides Row3, since auto layout skips hidden children, and each instance overrides Name and Total through findAll.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4240,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":46548,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4240}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"f0f74e6b-ab95-47de-9251-5a4472034e8e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:36:52.904Z","thinking_duration_ms":41355}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOmPVUbt7ECmKhAcvaEO","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01cn7VdFLJ3ExELodCcHgpW7","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans', style:s});\nconst sec = page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Components · Budget');\nconst getC = n=>sec.findOne(x=>x.name===n && x.type==='COMPONENT');\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nconst S=(h,a=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:a});\nconst C={ink:'#1A1A1F',sub:'#6E6A7C',ter:'#9E99AC',line:'#ECEAF2',track:'#EEEBF7',brand:'#6347EB',btint:'#EFEBFE',good:'#1FA97B',gtint:'#E5F5EE',warn:'#D9822B',wtint:'#FBEFE1',white:'#FFFFFF',bg:'#F6F5FA',blue:'#2D8CFF',btint2:'#E8F2FF',orange:'#EF9A3D',otint:'#FDF1E4'};\nfunction txt(ch,size,style,color,opt={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style:style||'Regular'};t.fontSize=size;t.characters=ch;t.fills=[S(color||C.ink)];t.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:opt.lh||135};t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';if(opt.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=opt.align;return t;}\nfunction fr(name,w,h,fill,r){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.resize(w,h);f.fills=fill?[S(fill)]:[];f.clipsContent=false;if(r)f.cornerRadius=r;return f;}\nfunction inst(name,comp){const i=comp.createInstance();i.name=name;return i;}\nfunction recolor(node,hex){node.findAll(n=>['VECTOR','BOOLEAN_OPERATION','RECTANGLE','ELLIPSE','POLYGON','STAR'].includes(n.type)&&'fills' in n).forEach(n=>{n.fills=[S(hex)];});}\nfunction shadow(a=.10,y=4,r=12){return {type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.24,g:0.19,b:0.47,a},offset:{x:0,y},radius:r,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'};}\n\n// ---------------- App/Header ----------------\nconst header=figma.createComponent(); header.name='App/Header'; header.resize(375,56); header.fills=[S(C.white)];\nheader.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; header.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; header.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; header.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; header.paddingLeft=16; header.paddingRight=16;\nheader.strokes=[S(C.line)]; header.strokeWeight=1; header.strokeAlign='INSIDE'; header.strokeBottomWeight=1; header.strokeTopWeight=0; header.strokeLeftWeight=0; header.strokeRightWeight=0;\nsec.appendChild(header);\nheader.appendChild(inst('Back',getC('Icon_Back')));\nconst hTitle=txt('Expenses',17,'SemiBold',C.ink); hTitle.name='Title'; hTitle.layoutGrow=1; hTitle.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';\nheader.appendChild(hTitle); header.appendChild(inst('Add',getC('Icon_Plus')));\nheader.x=30; header.y=410;\n\n// ---------------- App/Tab Bar ----------------\nfunction tabItem(label,icon,active){\n  const item=fr(label,60,48,null); item.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; item.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; item.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  item.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; item.itemSpacing=3; item.paddingTop=4; item.paddingBottom=0; item.paddingLeft=0; item.paddingRight=0;\n  const chip=fr('IconWrap',44,28,active?C.btint:null,14); chip.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; chip.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; chip.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  chip.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; chip.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const ic=inst(icon,getC(icon)); recolor(ic,active?C.brand:C.ter); chip.appendChild(ic);\n  const lab=txt(label,10,active?'SemiBold':'Medium',active?C.brand:C.ter); lab.name='Label';\n  item.appendChild(chip); item.appendChild(lab); return item;\n}\nfunction tabBar(name){\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name=name; c.resize(375,62); c.fills=[S(C.white)];\n  c.strokes=[S(C.line)]; c.strokeWeight=1; c.strokeAlign='INSIDE'; c.strokeTopWeight=1; c.strokeBottomWeight=0; c.strokeLeftWeight=0; c.strokeRightWeight=0;\n  const r=fr('Tabs',375,62,null); r.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; r.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; r.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  r.primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_EVENLY'; r.counterAxisAlignItems='MIN'; r.paddingTop=8; r.paddingBottom=0; r.paddingLeft=0; r.paddingRight=0;\n  [['Overview','Icon_Overview'],['This Month','Icon_This_Month'],['Offers','Icon_Offers'],['Setting','Icon_Setting']].forEach(([l,i])=>r.appendChild(tabItem(l,i,l==='This Month')));\n  c.appendChild(r); return c;\n}\nconst tabSet=figma.combineAsVariants([tabBar('State=Default'),tabBar('State=Current')],sec); tabSet.name='App/Tab Bar';\ntabSet.x=30; tabSet.y=490;\n\n// ---------------- App/Segmented ----------------\nfunction segVariant(activeLabel){\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='Active='+activeLabel; c.resize(343,44); c.fills=[S('#F1EEF9')]; c.cornerRadius=13;\n  c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; c.paddingLeft=4; c.paddingRight=4; c.paddingTop=4; c.paddingBottom=4; c.itemSpacing=4; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  ['Bills','Payments','Subscription'].forEach(label=>{\n    const act=label===activeLabel;\n    const s=fr(label,0,36,act?C.white:null,10); s.layoutGrow=1; s.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; s.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; s.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; s.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; s.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n    if(act)s.effects=[shadow(.10,2,6)];\n    s.appendChild(txt(label,13,act?'SemiBold':'Medium',act?C.brand:C.sub));\n    c.appendChild(s);\n  });\n  return c;\n}\nconst segSet=figma.combineAsVariants(['Bills','Payments','Subscription'].map(segVariant),sec); segSet.name='App/Segmented';\nsegSet.x=455; segSet.y=410;\n\n// ---------------- App/Progress ----------------\nconst prog=figma.createComponent(); prog.name='App/Progress'; prog.resize(311,4); prog.fills=[];\nconst trk=figma.createRectangle(); trk.name='Track'; trk.resize(311,4); trk.cornerRadius=2; trk.fills=[S(C.track)]; prog.appendChild(trk);\nconst fil=figma.createRectangle(); fil.name='Fill'; fil.resize(180,4); fil.cornerRadius=2; fil.fills=[S(C.brand)]; prog.appendChild(fil);\nsec.appendChild(prog); prog.x=455; prog.y=560;\n\n// ---------------- App/Period Picker ----------------\nconst pp=figma.createComponent(); pp.name='App/Period Picker'; pp.resize(343,40); pp.fills=[];\npp.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; pp.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; pp.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; pp.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nconst ppL=fr('Left',10,24,null); ppL.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; ppL.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; ppL.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; ppL.itemSpacing=6; ppL.layoutGrow=1;\nconst ppT=txt('September 2020',15,'SemiBold',C.ink); ppT.name='Period'; ppL.appendChild(ppT); ppL.appendChild(inst('Chevron',getC('Icon_Chevron_Down')));\nconst ppS=txt('Spent $1,812',12,'Medium',C.sub); ppS.name='Spent';\npp.appendChild(ppL); pp.appendChild(ppS);\nsec.appendChild(pp); pp.x=455; pp.y=610;\n\n// ---------------- App/More Row ----------------\nconst more=figma.createComponent(); more.name='App/More Row'; more.resize(343,56); more.fills=[S(C.white)]; more.cornerRadius=16; more.effects=[shadow(.05,2,8)];\nmore.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; more.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; more.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; more.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; more.paddingLeft=16; more.paddingRight=14;\nconst mw=fr('Ic',28,28,C.bg,9); mw.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; mw.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; mw.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; mw.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; mw.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nconst mi=inst('Icon_More',getC('Icon_More')); recolor(mi,C.sub); mw.appendChild(mi);\nconst mt=txt('More categories',14,'Medium',C.ink); mt.name='Label'; mt.layoutGrow=1;\nmore.appendChild(mw); more.appendChild(mt); more.appendChild(inst('Chevron',getC('Icon_Chevron_Right')));\nsec.appendChild(more); more.x=455; more.y=670;\n\n// ---------------- Rating/Chip ----------------\nfunction chipVariant(state){\n  const good=state==='Good';\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='State='+state; c.resize(60,22); c.cornerRadius=11; c.fills=[S(good?C.gtint:C.wtint)];\n  c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  c.paddingLeft=8; c.paddingRight=8; c.itemSpacing=4;\n  const d=figma.createEllipse(); d.name='Dot'; d.resize(5,5); d.fills=[S(good?C.good:C.warn)];\n  c.appendChild(d); c.appendChild(txt(state,10,'Bold',good?C.good:C.warn));\n  return c;\n}\nconst chipSet=figma.combineAsVariants(['Good','Not bad'].map(chipVariant),sec); chipSet.name='Rating/Chip';\nchipSet.x=455; chipSet.y=740;\n\n// ---------------- Category/Item Row ----------------\nconst ir=figma.createComponent(); ir.name='Category/Item Row'; ir.resize(311,52); ir.fills=[];\nir.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; ir.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; ir.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; ir.itemSpacing=6; ir.paddingTop=0; ir.paddingBottom=6; ir.paddingLeft=0; ir.paddingRight=0;\nconst irTop=fr('Top',311,18,null); irTop.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; irTop.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; irTop.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; irTop.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nconst irN=txt('Auto & transport',13,'Medium',C.ink); irN.name='Name'; irN.layoutGrow=1;\nconst irA=txt('$350',13,'SemiBold',C.ink); irA.name='Amount'; irA.textAlignHorizontal='RIGHT';\nirTop.appendChild(irN); irTop.appendChild(irA);\nconst irP=inst('Progress',prog); irP.name='Progress';\nconst irC=txt('Left $186',11,'Medium',C.ter); irC.name='Left';\nir.appendChild(irTop); ir.appendChild(irP); ir.appendChild(irC);\nsec.appendChild(ir); ir.x=900; ir.y=410;\n\n// ---------------- Category/Card ----------------\nfunction cardVariant(type){\n  const isTransport=type==='Transport';\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='Type='+type; c.resize(343,170); c.fills=[S(C.white)]; c.cornerRadius=18; c.effects=[shadow(.05,4,14)];\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.paddingLeft=16; c.paddingRight=16; c.paddingTop=16; c.paddingBottom=12; c.itemSpacing=12;\n  const top=fr('Card Header',311,32,null); top.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; top.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; top.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; top.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; top.itemSpacing=10;\n  const tile=fr('Tile',32,32,isTransport?C.btint2:C.otint,10); tile.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; tile.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; tile.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; tile.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; tile.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const ic=inst(isTransport?'Icon_Car':'Icon_Bill',getC(isTransport?'Icon_Car':'Icon_Bill')); recolor(ic,isTransport?C.blue:C.orange); tile.appendChild(ic);\n  const nm=txt(isTransport?'Auto & transport':'Bill & Utilities',15,'SemiBold',C.ink); nm.name='Category'; nm.layoutGrow=1;\n  const tot=txt(isTransport?'$600':'$320',15,'Bold',C.ink); tot.name='Total';\n  top.appendChild(tile); top.appendChild(nm); top.appendChild(tot);\n  c.appendChild(top);\n  for(let i=1;i<=3;i++){\n    const r=inst('Row'+i,ir); r.name='Row'+i;\n    c.appendChild(r);\n    if(isTransport&&i===3) r.visible=false;\n  }\n  return c;\n}\nconst cardSet=figma.combineAsVariants([cardVariant('Transport'),cardVariant('Bill')],sec); cardSet.name='Category/Card';\ncardSet.x=900; cardSet.y=520;\n\n// ---------------- Bill/Subscription Row ----------------\nconst subRow=figma.createComponent(); subRow.name='Bill/Subscription Row'; subRow.resize(343,72); subRow.fills=[S(C.white)];\nsubRow.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; subRow.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; subRow.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; subRow.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; subRow.paddingLeft=16; subRow.paddingRight=14; subRow.itemSpacing=12;\nconst logoTile=fr('LogoTile',44,44,C.white,13); logoTile.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; logoTile.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; logoTile.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; logoTile.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; logoTile.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nlogoTile.strokes=[S('#EEECF6')]; logoTile.strokeWeight=1; logoTile.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nconst logo=inst('Logo',getC('L