{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOmzsPSmHhOazifmWmrw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how to control progress fill widths inside nested instances. A fill rectangle inside an instance does not accept size overrides, and instances also cannot accept new children, so the fill width cannot be set per row at the screen level. The fix is to bake the width into the row master as variants: Category/Item Row gets 6 variants named Progress=30, 42, 60, 81, 86, and 100, each with its fill at that width. The card master uses a generic row, and each screen swaps the nested Row1 instance to the matching variant, since nested instance swaps are allowed.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2758,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":91847,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2758}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"d069c1ee-be7f-4f27-b757-0319b972d49b","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:43:50.482Z","thinking_duration_ms":15165}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOmzsPSmHhOazifmWmrw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Diagnosis: the fill sits inside nested instances (card → row → progress), and Figma refuses size overrides there — every resize was silently ignored. The fix is to carry the bar widths as real item-row variants instead of overrides.\n\nWhat I need next, and what can run in parallel:\n\n1. Build six `Category/Item Row` variants whose progress fill width is baked in (30/42/60/81/86/100 %).\n2. Swap each nested row instance in screen 01 to the matching variant (depends on 1).\n3. Screenshot the three screens again to confirm the bars and the score gauge (depends on 2).\n4. Verify the prototype reactions on the workspace page still exist after these edits.\n\nItems 3 and 4 are independent of each other, but both depend on 1 and 2, so I'll run 1 first."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2758,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":91847,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2758}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"3485112c-dce4-49ed-9fbf-a204430affa8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:43:59.360Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOmzsPSmHhOazifmWmrw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ODcSooUgAoGDtZOSIIRybm","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans', style:s});\nconst sec = page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Components · Budget');\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nconst S=(h,a=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:a});\nconst C={ink:'#1A1A1F',ter:'#9E99AC',brand:'#6347EB',track:'#EEEBF7',white:'#FFFFFF'};\nfunction txt(ch,size,style,color){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'DM Sans',style:style||'Regular'};t.fontSize=size;t.characters=ch;t.fills=[S(color||C.ink)];t.lineHeight={unit:'PERCENT',value:135};t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';return t;}\nfunction fr(name,w,h,fill,r){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.resize(w,h);f.fills=fill?[S(fill)]:[];f.clipsContent=false;if(r)f.cornerRadius=r;return f;}\n\nconst old=sec.findOne(n=>n.name==='Category/Item Row'&&n.type==='COMPONENT');\nconst x0=old?old.x:1100, y0=old?old.y:860;\nif(old) old.remove();\nconst parentOld=sec.findOne(n=>n.name==='Category/Item Row');\nif(parentOld) parentOld.remove();\n\nfunction rowVariant(name,fillW){\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='Progress='+name; c.resize(311,52); c.fills=[];\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.itemSpacing=6; c.paddingBottom=6; c.paddingLeft=0; c.paddingRight=0; c.paddingTop=0;\n  const top=fr('Top',311,18,null); top.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; top.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; top.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; top.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const n=txt('Auto & transport',13,'Medium',C.ink); n.name='Name'; n.layoutGrow=1;\n  const a=txt('$350',13,'SemiBold',C.ink); a.name='Amount'; a.textAlignHorizontal='RIGHT';\n  top.appendChild(n); top.appendChild(a);\n  const wrap=fr('Progress',311,4,null); \n  const tr=figma.createRectangle(); tr.name='Track'; tr.resize(311,4); tr.cornerRadius=2; tr.fills=[S(C.track)]; tr.x=0; tr.y=0;\n  const fl=figma.createRectangle(); fl.name='Fill'; fl.resize(fillW,4); fl.cornerRadius=2; fl.fills=[S(C.brand)]; fl.x=0; fl.y=0;\n  wrap.appendChild(tr); wrap.appendChild(fl);\n  const l=txt('Left $186',11,'Medium',C.ter); l.name='Left';\n  c.appendChild(top); c.appendChild(wrap); c.appendChild(l);\n  return c;\n}\nconst specs=[['0',0],['25',78],['42',131],['60',187],['81',252],['86',268],['100',311]];\nconst variants=specs.map(([n,w])=>rowVariant(n,w));\nconst set=figma.combineAsVariants(variants,sec); set.name='Category/Item Row';\nset.x=x0; set.y=y0;\nreturn JSON.stringify(variants.map(v=>v.name+' -> '+v.id));","description":"Rebuild item row as variants with baked progress widths","fileKey":"kief32CrRQEGf1OkI4f3T9"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2758,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":91847,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2758}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"5e6c87b8-91a1-496b-9ce2-e2f18f2f792d","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:44:01.425Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ODcSooUgAoGDtZOSIIRybm","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
