{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOnKusysZ2EpUPHSZ0ZQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I need next, from my checklist:\n\n- **Component-set integrity:** the tab bar set still reports 375×62 and the segmented set 343×44 after I appended the pressed variants, so those clones may be stacked outside the set's measured bounds. I need to read the variants' real positions and fix overlap.\n- **Pressed-state contents:** confirm the pressed tab carries the darker chip tint and the pressed segment carries the tinted active pill, and that the screens still bind to `State=Current`.\n- **Final page render** of the workspace, for the record.\n\nThe set-integrity and pressed-content reads touch the same nodes, so they go in one call with the render."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3304,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":118152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3304}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"91c3f5a7-245f-4b23-83be-4ef88e5cdc4e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:48:03.321Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOnKusysZ2EpUPHSZ0ZQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G7gw1scjbLJM2xwfjKBmId","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst sec=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Components · Budget');\nconst out={};\nfor(const nm of ['App/Tab Bar','App/Segmented']){\n  const set=sec.findOne(n=>n.name===nm);\n  out[nm]={type:set.type, w:Math.round(set.width), h:Math.round(set.height),\n    variants:set.children.map(c=>({name:c.name,x:Math.round(c.x),y:Math.round(c.y),w:Math.round(c.width),h:Math.round(c.height),type:c.type})),\n    abs:set.children.map(c=>{const bb=c.absoluteBoundingBox;return c.name+' '+Math.round(bb.x)+','+Math.round(bb.y)})\n  };\n}\n// pressed content checks\nconst tabSet=sec.findOne(n=>n.name==='App/Tab Bar');\nconst pr=tabSet.children.find(c=>c.name==='State=Pressed');\nconst prChips=pr.findAll(n=>n.name==='IconWrap').map(w=>w.fills.map(f=>'rgba('+[f.color.r,f.color.g,f.color.b].map(v=>Math.round(v*255)).join(',')+')'));\nconst segSet=sec.findOne(n=>n.name==='App/Segmented');\nconst sp=segSet.children.find(c=>c.name.includes('Pressed'));\nconst spPill=sp.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='Subscription').map(f=>f.fills.map(x=>JSON.stringify(x.color)));\nconst s1=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:85');\nreturn JSON.stringify({out, prChips, spPill, tabInstance:s1.findOne(n=>n.name==='Tab Bar').mainComponent.name},null,1);","description":"Check component set variants positions and pressed state contents","fileKey":"kief32CrRQEGf1OkI4f3T9"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3304,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":118152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3304}},"context_m