{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOnN7KV3JdfC7tEF3Vyf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I still need on my side:\n\n- The two component sets have their variants stacked at the same coordinates (Default/Current both at 0,0; Bills/Payments/Subscription all at 0,0), so only the top one is visible in the library. They need to be laid out side by side and the sets resized.\n- A final full-page render plus a structural read-back to confirm the page layout, screen positions and reaction list after that change.\n- Re-check that screen 01's bill card row swaps and the gauge didn't shift when the library reflows.\n\nThe variant layout and the render/read-back are independent of each other, so both go now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2710,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":121456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2710}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"3d721218-e806-42bf-9343-f084e8abbc3f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:48:30.674Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOnN7KV3JdfC7tEF3Vyf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HLh91U95BgFHT9bbvNRsgS","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst sec=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Components · Budget');\nconst GAP=16;\nconst laid=[];\nfor(const nm of ['App/Tab Bar','App/Segmented','Rating/Chip','Category/Item Row','Category/Card']){\n  const set=sec.findOne(n=>n.name===nm);\n  if(!set||set.type!=='COMPONENT_SET') continue;\n  let cursor=0, maxH=0;\n  set.children.forEach(c=>{ c.x=cursor; c.y=0; cursor+=c.width+GAP; maxH=Math.max(maxH,c.height); });\n  set.resize(cursor-GAP, maxH);\n  laid.push(nm+' -> '+Math.round(set.width)+'x'+Math.round(set.height)+' ('+set.children.length+' variants)');\n}\nawait new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,200));\n// overlap check across top-level masters after reflow\nconst b=sec.children.map(n=>({n:n.name,x:n.x,y:n.y,r:n.x+n.width,b:n.y+n.height}));\nconst ov=[];\nfor(let i=0;i<b.length;i++)for(let j=i+1;j<b.length;j++){const a=b[i],c=b[j];if(a.x<c.r&&c.x<a.r&&a.y<c.b&&c.y<a.b)ov.push(a.n+' X '+c.n);}\nreturn JSON.stringify({laid, overlaps:ov, sectionW:sec.width, rightMost:Math.round(Math.max(...sec.children.map(n=>n.x+n.width)))},null,1);","description":"Lay out component set variants side by side and check overlaps","fileKey":"kief32CrRQEGf1OkI4f3T9"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2710,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":121456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2710}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2d739e-c576-415e-8b81-afa8cdba9a76","uuid":"23ec75c8-b1dd-408b-b948-70bd44b0aedb","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:48:32.628Z","tool_us